## Build for packaging

```bash
mvn clean package
```

## Troubleshooting

### Java not found
Install JDK 21 and make sure it is active in your terminal.

### Maven not found
Install Maven and add it to your PATH.

### App does not start
Run:

```bash
mvn clean install
```

Then try:

```bash
mvn javafx:run
```

## Summary

This project is a simple and practical example of runtime theme switching in JavaFX. It helps you understand how to build a dashboard-style application where UI themes can be changed live while the app keeps working.
